{"seq":2,"slug":"user-behavior-analytics","title":"用户行为分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/user-behavior-analytics","wordCount":1561,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"用户行为分析\">用户行为分析</h1><p>埋点采集的原始事件流是一堆离散的数据点。用户行为分析的目标是从这些点中重建完整的用户旅程——谁来了、做了什么、留下了没有、为什么离开。这不是简单的 SQL 查询，而是一套将事件序列转化为产品洞察的方法论体系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>用户行为分析建立在三个基础之上：<strong>身份解析</strong>（将匿名设备 ID 与真实用户关联）、<strong>时序事件流</strong>（按时间排列的行为序列）和<strong>度量框架</strong>（将行为转化为可比较的数值指标）。三者共同支撑留存、路径、分群等上层分析模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"身份解析与用户拼接\">身份解析与用户拼接</h2><p>用户行为分析的第一步是&quot;知道我们在分析谁&quot;。移动端的身份解析（Identity Resolution）面临两个固有挑战：用户登录前后的匿名/实名切换，以及多设备场景下的用户合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Anonymous: 首次安装&#10;    Anonymous --&gt; Identified: 登录/注册&#10;    Identified --&gt; Anonymous: 登出&#10;    Anonymous --&gt; Merged: 再次登录(关联历史)&#10;    Merged --&gt; Identified: 合并完成&#10;    Identified --&gt; MultiDevice: 另一台设备登录&#10;    MultiDevice --&gt; Identified: 跨设备合并\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Anonymous: 首次安装\n    Anonymous --&gt; Identified: 登录/注册\n    Identified --&gt; Anonymous: 登出\n    Anonymous --&gt; Merged: 再次登录(关联历史)\n    Merged --&gt; Identified: 合并完成\n    Identified --&gt; MultiDevice: 另一台设备登录\n    MultiDevice --&gt; Identified: 跨设备合并</pre><p>匿名阶段使用设备级 ID（iOS 的 IDFV、Android 的 Instance ID）标识用户。一旦用户完成认证，系统执行 <code>identify</code> 调用将匿名 ID 与 <code>user_id</code> 绑定，历史事件追溯归属到该用户：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Android 示例：登录时执行身份合并&#10;analytics.identify(userId = &quot;user_12345&quot;) {&#10;    setAlias(previousAnonymousId)  // 将匿名期事件追溯归属&#10;    setProperty(&quot;signup_date&quot;, signupDate)&#10;    setProperty(&quot;plan_type&quot;, &quot;premium&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Android 示例：登录时执行身份合并</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>analytics.identify(userId = \"user_12345\") {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setAlias(previousAnonymousId)  // 将匿名期事件追溯归属</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setProperty(\"signup_date\", signupDate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    setProperty(\"plan_type\", \"premium\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>需要定义清楚的边界规则：登出后是否保留匿名 ID 的关联？重新安装后如何处理？多个匿名 ID 合并到同一 user_id 时如何去重？这些规则必须在埋点设计阶段就确定（参见<a href=\"event-tracking-design\">事件埋点设计</a>），事后修改代价极高。</p>\n<h2 id=\"留存分析\">留存分析</h2><p>留存率（Retention Rate）是衡量产品是否创造持久价值的核心指标。移动应用行业的基准数据：Day 1 留存约 25-30%，Day 7 约 10-15%，Day 30 约 5-8%。</p>\n<p>留存分析的标准方法是<strong>同期群分析</strong>（Cohort Analysis）——将用户按首次使用日期分组，追踪每组在后续时间窗口内的回访率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>安装周</th>\n<th>Week 0</th>\n<th>Week 1</th>\n<th>Week 2</th>\n<th>Week 3</th>\n<th>Week 4</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>6月第1周</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>32%</td>\n<td>21%</td>\n<td>16%</td>\n<td>13%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6月第2周</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>35%</td>\n<td>24%</td>\n<td>18%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6月第3周</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>28%</td>\n<td>19%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>6月第4周</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>33%</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>留存曲线的形状揭示产品健康度。典型的健康曲线在 Day 7 后趋于平坦（找到了核心用户群），而持续下滑的曲线意味着产品缺乏核心价值——用户来了、看了、没有留下的理由。</p>\n<p>留存率的数学表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>∣</mo><mtext>active</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R(d) = \\frac{|\\{u \\in C_0 \\mid \\text{active}(u, d)\\}|}{|C_0|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">active</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)}</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为某日新增用户集合，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>active</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{active}(u, d)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">active</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 表示用户 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 天有活跃行为。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户路径分析\">用户路径分析</h2><p>路径分析（Path Analysis）回答&quot;用户是如何从 A 到达 B 的&quot;——或者更关键地，&quot;用户为什么没有到达 B&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>正向路径</strong>：从指定起点事件出发，统计后续 N 步的事件分布。用于发现用户的自然使用模式，识别出产品设计者未预期的高频路径。</p>\n<p><strong>逆向路径</strong>：从目标事件（如付费）回溯，分析哪些前置行为序列最终导向了转化。这比正向路径更有决策价值——它直接告诉你&quot;什么行为驱动了核心转化&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[app_opened] --&gt; B[home_feed_viewed]&#10;    A --&gt; C[search_initiated]&#10;    B --&gt; D[product_viewed&lt;br/&gt;45%]&#10;    B --&gt; E[category_browsed&lt;br/&gt;30%]&#10;    B --&gt; F[notification_clicked&lt;br/&gt;25%]&#10;    D --&gt; G[add_to_cart&lt;br/&gt;22%]&#10;    D --&gt; H[session_end&lt;br/&gt;78%]&#10;    G --&gt; I[purchase_completed&lt;br/&gt;65%]&#10;    G --&gt; J[cart_abandoned&lt;br/&gt;35%]\">flowchart TD\n    A[app_opened] --&gt; B[home_feed_viewed]\n    A --&gt; C[search_initiated]\n    B --&gt; D[product_viewed&lt;br/&gt;45%]\n    B --&gt; E[category_browsed&lt;br/&gt;30%]\n    B --&gt; F[notification_clicked&lt;br/&gt;25%]\n    D --&gt; G[add_to_cart&lt;br/&gt;22%]\n    D --&gt; H[session_end&lt;br/&gt;78%]\n    G --&gt; I[purchase_completed&lt;br/&gt;65%]\n    G --&gt; J[cart_abandoned&lt;br/&gt;35%]</pre><p>路径分析的工程实现依赖事件序列的时序排列。核心数据结构是按 <code>(user_id, session_id, timestamp)</code> 排序的事件序列，通过滑动窗口提取 N-gram 模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用户分群与行为标签\">用户分群与行为标签</h2><p>分群（Segmentation）将用户按行为特征划分为可独立分析的子集。相比静态属性分群（如按地区、设备型号），行为分群更有产品决策价值：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>频率分群</strong>：高频用户（日活 ≥5 次会话）vs 低频用户（周活 ≤2 次）</li>\n<li><strong>功能偏好分群</strong>：重度搜索用户 vs 推荐流浏览用户</li>\n<li><strong>生命周期分群</strong>：新用户（安装 &lt;7 天）→ 活跃用户 → 沉默用户（&gt;14 天无活跃）→ 流失用户（&gt;30 天）</li>\n<li><strong>价值分群</strong>：付费用户按 LTV 分层（鲸鱼用户 / 中度付费 / 微付费）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>RFM 模型（Recency-Frequency-Monetary）是电商类应用最常用的分群框架：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>RFM Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Recency</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>F</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Frequency</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>M</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>Monetary</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{RFM Score} = w_R \\cdot \\text{Recency} + w_F \\cdot \\text{Frequency} + w_M \\cdot \\text{Monetary}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">RFM Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Frequency</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Monetary</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中每个维度按五分位数打 1-5 分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>F</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>M</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_R, w_F, w_M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为权重（通常各取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{3}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"会话分析与活跃度量\">会话分析与活跃度量</h2><p>会话（Session）是用户一次连续使用的时间窗口。会话的边界定义影响所有下游指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>默认会话超时</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Firebase Analytics</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>超过 30min 无事件则视为新会话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sentry</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>同上，但 app 进入后台 &gt;30s 也切分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Amplitude</td>\n<td>30 分钟（可配置 5-1440min）</td>\n<td>配置驱动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Apple App Analytics</td>\n<td>不公开，约 30 分钟</td>\n<td>Apple 内部定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>基于会话的核心度量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>DAU/MAU 比率</strong>（粘性指数）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mtext>DAU</mtext><mtext>MAU</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{\\text{DAU}}{\\text{MAU}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">MAU</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DAU</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>，反映用户日均回访频率。社交类应用通常 &gt;50%，工具类 &lt;20%。</li>\n<li><strong>平均会话时长</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mtext>end</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mtext>start</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{T}_s = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(t_{\\text{end},i} - t_{\\text{start},i})}{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.405em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.06em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.535em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op mtight\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7385em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1786em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.931em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3214em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3488em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">end</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2901em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">start</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li><strong>每用户日均会话数</strong>：高频 = 产品有足够多的&quot;回来理由&quot;</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"事件序列与漏斗的衔接\">事件序列与漏斗的衔接</h2><p>行为分析的产出最终要导向可执行的产品决策。当路径分析发现用户在某环节大量流失时，需要进一步构建<a href=\"attribution-funnel\">归因与漏斗分析</a>来量化转化瓶颈。行为分析提供&quot;在哪里出了问题&quot;的线索，归因漏斗则量化&quot;问题的严重程度&quot;和&quot;改进后的提升幅度&quot;。</p>\n<p>同样，行为分析中发现的异常模式（如某版本用户突然大量中断会话）往往是崩溃或卡顿的信号——需要与<a href=\"../crash-stability/crash-reporting-systems\">崩溃上报体系</a>的数据交叉验证，将&quot;用户行为异常&quot;与&quot;技术稳定性问题&quot;关联起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>用户行为分析将原始事件流转化为可决策的产品洞察。身份解析是基础——没有正确的用户拼接就没有可信的留存数据；同期群留存揭示产品是否创造持久价值；路径分析发现设计者未预期的使用模式；行为分群将用户按可操作的维度划分。这些分析能力的天花板取决于上游埋点的完整性和准确性。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"用户行为分析","id":"用户行为分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"身份解析与用户拼接","id":"身份解析与用户拼接"},{"level":2,"text":"留存分析","id":"留存分析"},{"level":2,"text":"用户路径分析","id":"用户路径分析"},{"level":2,"text":"用户分群与行为标签","id":"用户分群与行为标签"},{"level":2,"text":"会话分析与活跃度量","id":"会话分析与活跃度量"},{"level":2,"text":"事件序列与漏斗的衔接","id":"事件序列与漏斗的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"事件埋点设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/event-tracking-design"},"next":{"title":"归因与漏斗分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-analytics-crash-reporting/analytics-fundamentals/attribution-funnel"}}